Package: colorful-control-center
Version: 1.0.5
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Colorful Control Center <local@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), systemd, kmod
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, curl, openssl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: 0
Description: 隐星控制中心 - 风扇与键盘灯效控制 (Colorful P15 / Clevo)
 A Linux control center for Colorful XING P15 (Clevo barebone) laptops.
 Features:
  - Fan speed control: auto / quiet / balanced / performance / full speed,
    custom temperature-fan curve, manual fixed speed
  - RGB keyboard backlight: on/off, brightness, per-zone colors and
    hardware effects (breathe, cycle, wave, ...)
  - Live monitoring: CPU/GPU/NVMe temperatures, fan RPM, battery
 .
 It uses a small kernel bridge (clevo_cc) exposing the OEM Clevo firmware
 interface (ACPI CLV0001 _DSM or WMI ABBC0F6D) as /dev/clevo_cc, the same
 interface used by the Windows "Control Center".
 兼容: 七彩虹隐星 P15 系列等蓝天(Clevo)模具笔记本.
